          "doc_text": " This function returns a function that lets you index the given array in const.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            265,
            347
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " As implemented it can optimize better than iterators, and can be constified.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            352,
            432
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " It acts like a sort of guard (owns the array) and iterator combined, which can be implemented",
