          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            591,
            684
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " The only method you're really allowed to call is `next()`,",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            689,
            751
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " anything else is more or less UB, hence this function being unsafe.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            756,
            827
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
